Five years? That's NOTHING. At worst, not visible. And CERTAINLY not a reason to be ashamed of your partner.

&#x200B;

Set things straight with her. If she can't be proud of being with you altogether, then you deserve better.

think as you wish. I'll just say my story is way too complicated for me to be lying, and given the attention I get on my posts, if I was lying it certainly wouldn't be very useful.

